WEBVTT

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.442
It adds together the interference pattern

00:00:31.442 --> 00:00:34.721
from two raindrops that land near each other.

00:00:34.721 --> 00:00:39.868
Instead of expanding circles, they're expanding hexagons.

00:00:44.945 --> 00:00:49.229
All the sculptures move by mechanical means.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:59.125
Do you see how there's three peaks to the yellow sine wave?

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:05.225
Right here I'm adding a sine wave with four peaks and turning it on.